{"scale":100,"source":"anilist","value":85},"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2016,"series":["al-21399","al-9260","al-21400","al-15689","al-5081","al-11597","al-17074","al-21262","al-20918","al-21745"],"seriesIds":[21399,9260,21400,15689,5081,11597,17074,21262,20918,21745],"startDate":{"day":19,"month":8,"year":2016},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":44,"name":"Shaft"},{"animation":false,"id":159,"name":"Kodansha"},{"animation":false,"id":17,"name":"Aniplex"},{"animation":false,"id":245,"name":"Toho"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"First season of the Monogatari Series, part 3/6. Contains the arc Koyomi Vamp from the Kizumonogatari light novel.\n\nIn the spring of his second year of high school, Koyomi Araragi met the beautiful vampire Kiss-Shot Acerola-Orion Heart-Under-Blade. Koyomi saved Kiss-shot, who was on the verge of death with all four of her limbs cut off, but only at the expense of becoming her minion and a vampire. “In order to go back to being a human again, you must take back all of Kiss-shot’s limbs.” After receiving advice from Meme Oshino, an expert in the supernatural, Koyomi prepares to go into battle.\n\nAwaiting him are three powerful vampire hunters—Dramaturgy, a giant vampire hunter who is a vampire himself. Episode, a half-vampire who wields an enormous cross, and Guillotinecutter, a quiet man who specializes in killing vampires. Will Koyomi be able to take back Kiss-Shot’s limbs from the vampire hunters? Amidst the soft spring rain, the curtain rises on this fateful blood bath…\n\n(Source: Aniplex)"},"tags":[{"name":"Vampire","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rotoscoping","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Noir","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":69,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Regression","rank":66,"spoiler":false}